transfer/filebrowser is the File Browser web server (https://filebrowser.org,
https://github.com/filebrowser/filebrowser), built for 32-bit ARM e-readers.
File Browser is Copyright the File Browser Contributors and is licensed under
the Apache License, Version 2.0 (https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0).
The binary is unmodified; it is the one shipped in FilebrowserPlus 1.3.0.

ShelfTechUI's Transfer (bos_transfer.lua) takes over from the FilebrowserPlus
plugin by Neeraj Patel, which derives from KOReader's filebrowser.koplugin
(GNU AGPL v3). bos_transfer.lua is under the AGPL v3 like the rest of
ShelfTechUI.
